IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-CLAWVM-PAGETBL.

DATA DIVISION.
01 SESSION-TURNS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 COMPACTIONS         PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 RESETS              PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 PRIVATE-PAGES       PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-CLAWVM-PAGETBL.
    MOVE SESSION-TURNS TO R14.
    DIVIDE 5 INTO R14.
    ADD 2 TO R14.
    MOVE R14 TO PRIVATE-PAGES.

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 SESSION-TURNS.
    WEIGHT 30 PRIVATE-PAGES.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 15.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

END-STRATEGY.
